# <type>(<scope>): <subject>
#
# Types: feat fix perf refactor style docs test build ci chore revert
# Subject: imperative, lower-case, no trailing period. Header <= 100 chars.
#
# Body: what changed and why, wrapped at about 80 columns. Blank line above.
#
# Footers, blank line above:
#   Refs: #123
#   BREAKING CHANGE: what broke, and what to do instead
